        "label": "Launch — Proton-K / Blok D",
        "description": "Baikonur Cosmodrome, 1976-08-09. Luna 24 — the final mission of the Soviet Luna program and the last soft lunar landing of any nation until China's Chang'e 3 (2013), 37 years later."
      },
      {
        "met_days": 0.1,
